---
title: Glamping – Wooden Tent Prices
mo_ta: Ha Tien glamping at Lalasea — air-conditioned wooden tents in the grounds of a beachfront restaurant on To Chau beach, a few dozen metres from the sea. From 490,000 VND per person including breakfast + BBQ hotpot dinner. Check-in 14:00, call +84 907 896 949.
anh_dai_dien: /uploads/585bccbb09ef89b1d0fe5.jpg
permalink: /en/glamping/
ban_dich: /glamping/
---
{#- Bản tiếng Anh của src/glamping.njk. Giá lấy chung từ src/_data/glamping.json
    (lọc qua giaEn để viết kiểu quốc tế); chữ lấy từ các trường *_en, thiếu thì
    dùng tạm chữ tiếng Việt. -#}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Campground",
  "@id": "{{ thongtin.site_url }}/glamping/#glamping",
  "name": "Glamping Lalasea",
  "alternateName": ["Lalasea Bistro Camping", "Camping Lalasea Hà Tiên", "Lều gỗ Lalasea"],
  "description": "Glamping area with air-conditioned A-frame wooden tents inside the grounds of Lalasea Bistro, a few dozen metres from To Chau beach, Ha Tien. Packages include a BBQ – hotpot dinner and breakfast.",
  "url": "{{ thongtin.site_url }}/en/glamping/",
  "image": "{{ thongtin.site_url }}{{ anh_dai_dien }}",
  "telephone": "+84{{ thongtin.dien_thoai_goi | replace('0', '', 1) }}",
  "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "streetAddress": "QL80, Tô Châu", "addressLocality": "Hà Tiên", "addressRegion": "An Giang", "addressCountry": "VN" },
  "geo": { "@type": "GeoCoordinates", "latitude": {{ thongtin.vi_do }}, "longitude": {{ thongtin.kinh_do }} },
  "priceRange": "490,000 – 890,000 VND per person",
  "checkinTime": "14:00",
  "checkoutTime": "12:00",
  "petsAllowed": false,
  "amenityFeature": [
    { "@type": "LocationFeatureSpecification", "name": "Air-conditioned tents", "value": true },
    { "@type": "LocationFeatureSpecification", "name": "Breakfast", "value": true },
    { "@type": "LocationFeatureSpecification", "name": "BBQ – hotpot dinner", "value": true },
    { "@type": "LocationFeatureSpecification", "name": "On-site restaurant", "value": true },
    { "@type": "LocationFeatureSpecification", "name": "Near the beach", "value": true }
  ],
  "containedInPlace": { "@id": "{{ thongtin.site_url }}/#nhahang" },
  "sameAs": ["{{ thongtin.facebook }}", "{{ thongtin.tiktok }}", "{{ thongtin.maps }}"]
}
</script>

<div class="page-hero">
  <span class="script-accent" style="display:block; margin-bottom:4px;">Sleep among the trees — wake up with the sunrise</span>
  <h1>Glamping Lalasea</h1>
  <p>A-frame wooden tents with air conditioning, ventilation fans and comfy mattresses, inside the restaurant grounds in To Chau, Ha Tien — just a few dozen metres from the sea. Seafood in the afternoon, BBQ by the fire at night, and sunrise from the seaside dining area in the morning.</p>
</div>

<!-- ===== PRICES ===== -->
<section class="gprice">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title reveal">
      <span class="script-accent">Eat – sleep – enjoy, all in one</span>
      <h2>Glamping prices</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="gprice-note reveal">{{ glamping.gia_ghi_chu_en or glamping.gia_ghi_chu }}</p>
    <div class="gprice-grid reveal">
      {% for bang in glamping.bang_gia %}
      <div class="gprice-card{% if loop.index == 2 %} hot{% endif %}">
        <div class="head">
          <h3>{{ bang.ten_en or bang.ten }}</h3>
          <span>{{ bang.ngay_en or bang.ngay }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rows">
          {% for m in bang.muc %}
          <div class="row"><span class="k">{{ m.khach_en or m.khach }}</span><span class="g">{{ m.gia | giaEn }}</span></div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="gprice-note reveal" style="margin-top:28px;">💡 The more of you, the more you save — groups of 5–6 from just <strong>490,000 VND per person</strong> on weekdays.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== WHAT'S INCLUDED ===== -->
<section class="gpack" style="background:#fff;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title reveal">
      <span class="script-accent">You won't go hungry</span>
      <h2>What the glamping package includes</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="gpack-grid">
      <div class="gpack-card reveal">
        <div class="ph">☀️ Breakfast</div>
        <p class="mota">{{ glamping.bua_sang_mota_en or glamping.bua_sang_mota }}</p>
        <div class="cols">
          <div>
            <h3>Breakfast dishes</h3>
            <ul>{% for m in (glamping.bua_sang_mon_en if glamping.bua_sang_mon_en and glamping.bua_sang_mon_en.length else glamping.bua_sang_mon) %}<li>{{ m }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Drinks</h3>
            <ul>{% for m in (glamping.bua_sang_nuoc_en if glamping.bua_sang_nuoc_en and glamping.bua_sang_nuoc_en.length else glamping.bua_sang_nuoc) %}<li>{{ m }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gpack-card reveal">
        <div class="ph">🔥 Dinner — BBQ &amp; Hotpot</div>
        <p class="mota">{{ glamping.bua_toi_mota_en or glamping.bua_toi_mota }}</p>
        <div class="bbq-rows">
          {% for m in glamping.bbq %}
          <div class="row"><span class="k">{{ m.mon_en or m.mon }}</span><span class="g">{{ m.luong_en or m.luong }}</span></div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="chu-thich">⭐ Dishes and portions are served according to the number of guests in the tent.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== TENT PHOTOS ===== -->
{% if glamping.anh.length > 0 %}
<section class="gallery">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title reveal">
      <span class="script-accent">Inside your tent</span>
      <h2>Tent photos</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="gallery-grid reveal">
      {% for item in glamping.anh %}
      <div class="tile"><img src="{{ item.file }}" alt="{{ item.mota_en or 'Lalasea glamping tent, Ha Tien' }}" loading="lazy">{% if item.mota_en %}<div class="cap">{{ item.mota_en }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<!-- ===== CHECK-IN / CHECK-OUT ===== -->
<section class="grule">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title reveal">
      <span class="script-accent">Arrival &amp; departure</span>
      <h2>Stay policy</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grule-grid reveal">
      <div class="grule-card">
        <div class="ic">🌤️</div>
        <h3>Check-in</h3>
        <div class="time">{{ glamping.checkin_en or glamping.checkin }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="grule-card">
        <div class="ic">🌙</div>
        <h3>Check-out</h3>
        <div class="time">{{ glamping.checkout_en or glamping.checkout }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="gnote-list reveal">
      {% for n in (glamping.luu_y_en if glamping.luu_y_en and glamping.luu_y_en.length else glamping.luu_y) %}<li>{{ n }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== RESERVE A TENT ===== -->
<section class="visit">
  <div class="container" style="text-align:center; max-width:720px;">
    <div class="section-title reveal">
      <span class="script-accent">Only a few tents</span>
      <h2>Reserve a tent for your trip</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal" style="opacity:.9; margin:-20px 0 28px;">Weekends and holidays often book up — call or message us on Zalo to reserve ahead.</p>
    <div class="reveal">
      <a class="hotline" href="tel:+84{{ thongtin.dien_thoai_goi | replace('0', '', 1) }}" style="font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px);">📞 {{ thongtin.dien_thoai | sdtQuocTe }}</a>
      <div style="margin-top:22px;">
        <a href="tel:+84{{ thongtin.dien_thoai_goi | replace('0', '', 1) }}" class="btn btn-lg">Call to reserve</a>
        <a href="{{ thongtin.zalo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-left:12px;">💬 Message on Zalo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
